# Intelligence API - REST Client test file
# Use with the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above any ### block to execute it.
# Requires the API running locally: make run or docker compose up

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = test-admin-key
@lookupKey = test-basic-key
@proKey = test-pro-key
@freeKey = test-free-key

### API docs landing page (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/docs

### Domain Intelligence docs (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/docs/domain

### IP Intelligence docs (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/docs/ip

### OpenAPI specification (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/docs/openapi.yaml

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/v1/hello

### Dependency health (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/v1/health

### App info (admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Domain lookup (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-admin-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup (basic key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-lookup-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com", "example.org"]
}

### Domain lookup (pro key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{proKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-pro-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup (free key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-free-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 400 (free key, too many domains)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com", "example.org"]
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot - should return 403 (free key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true
}

